# Toolchain versions for asdf / mise / rtx.
#
# Run `asdf install` (or `mise install`) in this directory to materialise
# everything listed below. The format is `<plugin> <version>` per line.
#
# Every version here is CHECKED against the pin the repo itself enforces, by
# scripts/check_toolchain_pins.mjs — including the commented lines, because a
# commented pin is a claim the next reader will uncomment (decisions § 911).
# The sources of truth are:
#
#   nodejs    — every workflow's `actions/setup-node` step (major only; asdf
#               wants a resolvable version, CI states a major)
#   rust      — apps/custom_watch/rust-toolchain.toml
#   golang    — apps/*/go.mod
#   flutter   — each workflow's top-level env.FLUTTER_VERSION
#   terraform — .github/workflows/terraform.yml
#   deno      — each workflow's `denoland/setup-deno` step (exact, not a
#               channel: a Deno minor carries new `deno check` diagnostics)
#
# The rest carry no in-repo pin, so nothing can check them: python3 / zola are
# whatever the runner ships.

nodejs 24

